  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Handicap International disabled ex-combatants</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Handicap International handikappade exkombattanter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kapacitet och m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r         handkappade ex-kombattanter och deras familjer att bidra till fred    och utveckling. The komponenter ing&#xe5;r: psyko-socialt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att     st&#xf6;dja social &#xe5;terintegrering, ekonomisk integrering, samt            kapacitetsbyggande av handikapporganisationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to improve the capacity and         opportunities for disabled ex-combatants and their families to        contribute and benefit from long-term conditions for peace and        development. Three project components are identified: psycho-social   support for social reintegration; economic reintegration; and         capacity-building of self-help organizations (Disabled Persons Org)</narrative>
  </description>
